&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of executing best-in-class influencer programs and high-profile celebrity campaigns that broke through the noise and drove measurable cultural impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional negotiation skills, with a deep understanding of SAG-AFTRA regulations, licensing, and digital talent usage rights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven mindset, with a strong skillset in analyzing campaign performance metrics, translating data into compelling reports, and deriving insights to inform optimization strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A cultural pulse on &quot;the next big thing&quot;—you know who is trending and what content consumers are leaning into before they go viral.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working specifically with technology or mobility brands, translating complex product features into consumer-friendly narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background working at an influencer marketing or talent agency and/or in-house on a brand’s influencer or talent marketing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing external influencer and celebrity marketing agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global talent expertise with experience managing talent partnerships across the US, EMEA and APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with PR and Earned Media, knowing how to turn talent partnerships into headline-grabbing moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine passion for autonomous technology and a forward-thinking vision for how it improves urban mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-3 times per quarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$177,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$218,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;On the Waymo Marketing team, you will help to connect people with the magic and impact of Waymo&#39;s autonomous driving technology. Our team has the unique opportunity to not only grow Waymo&#39;s brand from the ground up, but to also build societal acceptance for autonomous driving technology for the first time in history. We build thoughtful marketing strategy, positioning, messaging and creative assets to deliver messages that matter to our audience, communicated through anything from video content, to social media interactions, to immersive physical experiences. We also shape Waymo&#39;s go-to-market initiatives, helping to transform Waymo into a thriving business with a growing user base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report to the Brand Marketing &amp;amp; Operations Lead.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define Vertical Partnership Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect the long-term vision for Waymo’s involvement in the Sports, Finance, and Hospitality sectors. Identify and secure cornerstone partners that position Waymo as a premium, indispensable utility for travelers, fans, and consumers&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Deal Negotiations:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive end-to-end management of complex, multi-year agreements. You will lead the negotiation of high-visibility deals, ensuring Waymo secures best-in-class terms and media value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Integrated Go-To-Market (GTM):&lt;/strong&gt; Bring to life our partnerships and events in creative ways that resonate with audiences. Collaborate with internal cross-functional (XFN) teams and external agencies to ensure every activation drives measurable awareness and accelerates rider growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure Impact&lt;/strong&gt;: Establish a data-driven framework for ROI, focusing on increasing awareness, engagement, and advocacy for our service. You will help move the needle on how the world perceives autonomous transportation through clear, quantifiable metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Planning: &lt;/strong&gt;Translate overarching brand and business goals into actionable roadmaps. You will define the strategic approach for major programs, including high-impact stunt activations, international conferences, and global sponsorships..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage large-scale financial allocations for partnership fees and co-marketing spends. You will optimize deal structures to maximize ROI across all brand partnership efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of brand leadership experience, with a focus on strategic partnership identification, high-stakes negotiation, and large-scale activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of managing global brand portfolios within complex, matrixed organizations (e.g. Financial Services, Tech, Global CPG).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in agency management, specifically across sports, venues, and title sponsorships, with a demonstrated portfolio of activations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven approach to marketing that effectively balances &quot;big idea&quot; creative vision with rigorous, specific ROI metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational flexibility, with the proven ability to pivot seamlessly between high-level strategic development and granular hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing or mentoring team members, demonstrating people leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in the autonomous vehicle, automotive, or high-growth technology industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating deeply with product and technical teams, ensuring all marketing initiatives are grounded in the reality of the technology and product capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of brand safety and policy issues related to emerging technology, and experience working closely with legal, policy and public affairs teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel globally as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$243,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$308,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;This role reports to our Charging Infrastructure Program Manager.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and refine engineering designs, specifications, and procedures to eliminate single points of failure across mechanical, electrical, and civil systems in critical facilities (e.g., service centers, vehicle chargers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform rigorous Failure Modes and Effects Analysis (FMEA) and Root Cause Analysis (RCA) on existing and proposed systems to identify weaknesses and quantify risk, providing clear recommendations for mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the subject matter expert to review all design documents, equipment specifications, construction submittals, and factory test results to ensure compliance with targeted redundancy topologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create detailed Integrated Systems Testing and operational readiness procedures to validate the failover capabilities and resilience of complex, inter-dependent utility and infrastructure systems including Smart Building Automation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all redundancy designs and modifications adhere to relevant industry standards, codes (e.g., NFPA, ASHRAE, seismic codes), and internal reliability metrics and availability SLAs. Ensure all redundancy projects are completed within allocated time and budget.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with project managers and vendor partners to prioritize and scope capital improvement projects focused on redundancy upgrades, system modernization, and mitigating facility risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 + years of professional experience in designing, implementing, and commissioning mission-critical infrastructure, specifically within mechanical (HVAC, cooling systems), electrical power (UPS, switchgear, generators), and/or civil/structural systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level knowledge of diverse redundancy topologies (e.g., N, N+1, N+2, 2N, 2N+1) and the ability to design and validate systems ensuring target Service Level Agreements (SLAs) for uptime and availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading cross-functional engineering teams and external consultants, driving the redundancy review process from conceptual design through construction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thorough understanding of relevant building codes, industry standards (e.g., Uptime Institute Tiers, ANSI/TIA-942), and safety regulations related to critical power, fire suppression, and structural integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certification or Industry Designation in Project, Engineering or Facilities Services&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in mixed use environments - office, industrial, labs or manufacturing&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable PM skills; able to advance projects with undefined scope, influence and align stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role requires travel approximately 35% of the time. Specifically, the employee will be expected to travel between Bay Area and Washington DC locations as part of their job responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$178,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$192,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The Business Development and Partnerships team helps plan Waymo&#39;s dynamic future and drive the company&#39;s go-to-market strategy. We work cross-functionally and leverage quantitative and qualitative analysis to build forward-looking partnerships that deliver on Waymo&#39;s strategic business objectives. As a member of this entrepreneurial and results-oriented team, you will have a significant impact on defining, developing and executing Waymo&#39;s commercial deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report to a Head of Business Development &amp;amp; Strategic Partnerships, Commercial Growth.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ビジネス開発チームおよびパートナーシップ チームは、Waymo のダイナミックな未来構想と市場開拓戦略の推進を担っています。部門横断的に活動し、定量的および定性的な分析を駆使して、Waymo の戦略的なビジネス目標を達成するための将来を見据えたパートナーシップを構築します。起業家精神にあふれ、結果を重視する本チームの一員として、Waymo の商用デプロイを実現するための重要サービスの定義、開発、実行において大きな影響を持つ役割を担当していただきます。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will / &lt;/strong&gt;業務内容:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute on a strategic partnerships strategy and plan to ensure successful go-to-market in Japan /&amp;nbsp;戦略的パートナーシップの立案と実行を通じて、日本における市場参入を成功に導く&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, create, negotiate and implement local strategic partnerships across the AV partnerships ecosystem, including operations and fleet partners, city and transit organizations, airports and other partners that support go-to-market, education/awareness, and growth/&amp;nbsp;運用およびフリートのパートナー、自治体や交通機関、空港、さらには市場認知の向上や成長を支援する各団体など、自律運転エコシステム全般にわたる地域の戦略的パートナーシップを特定、構築し、交渉から実装を行う&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Waymo Policy &amp;amp; Government Affairs and Legal teams to help influence national and local regulatory frameworks to enable testing and commercial deployment /&amp;nbsp;Waymo の政策および政府渉外チーム、法務チームと緊密に連携し、国や地域の規制の枠組みへの働きかけをサポートし、テストとおよび商用デプロイを可能にする&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can effectively represent Waymo in high stake external meetings with the government and strategic partners /&amp;nbsp;政府機関や戦略的パートナーとの重要な外部会議において、Waymo を代表して効果的な説明を行う&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a primary bridge between the Japan-based team and global teams at Waymo HQ, coordinating closely with partnerships efforts managed centrally and serving as a key voice representing local partnership interests, trends, and nuances.&amp;nbsp; Help Waymo achieve long term success in Japan with the most thoughtful approach - influence global thinking with a deep understanding of local nuances / 日本拠点と Waymo 本社のグローバル チームをつなぐ主要な窓口となり、本社が統括するパートナーシップ戦略と密に連携しつつ、国内におけるパートナーシップのニーズやトレンド、文化的背景を共有する。日本特有の市場環境や習慣への深い理解に基づき、グローバル戦略への反映を行うことで、Waymo が日本で長期的な成功を収めるための最適かつ配慮あるアプローチを支援する&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with teams across time zones to define strategy, solve complex problems, execute business initiatives, create work plans, lead analyses, develop and communicate final recommendations to move partnerships forward and ensure their ongoing success /&amp;nbsp;異なるタイムゾーンのチームと連携して戦略を定義し、複雑な課題解決やビジネス イニシアチブの実行、作業計画の策定から分析の主導を担う。また、パートナーシップを前進させて継続的な成功を確実にするための最終提言の作成および伝達を行う&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have / 必要な条件/経験:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of work experience, including 5+ years in business development or strategic partnerships in the technology, transportation and/or mobility sector /&amp;nbsp;8 年以上の実務経験。そのうち 5 年以上は、テクノロジー、運輸、モビリティ分野における事業開発または戦略的パートナーシップの領域の経験であること&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full business proficiency in both Japanese and English language (verbal and written) and the ability to cross-contextualize and communicate effectively across both Japanese and US cultures and styles /&amp;nbsp;日本語および英語における高いビジネス語学力（会話および読み書き）。日米両方の文化やスタイルの違いを深く理解し、文脈を補完しながら効果的にコミュニケーションを図る能力&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience structuring and negotiating strategic partnership agreements /&amp;nbsp;戦略的パートナーシップ契約の構築および交渉における実務経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and influencing a cross-functional team, particularly a team that includes policy, operations, product, marketing and finance stakeholders /&amp;nbsp;部門横断的なチーム（特に政策、運用、プロダクト、マーケティング、財務などのステークホルダーを含むチーム）を牽引し、組織に影響を与えた経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience /&amp;nbsp;学士号、またはそれに相当する実務経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Prefer / &lt;/strong&gt;望ましい条件/経験:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the autonomous vehicle, ride hailing or broader mobility industries /&amp;nbsp;自律運転車、配車サービス、または幅広いモビリティ業界における深い知識&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the Japanese business landscape, culture, and regulatory environment (especially in mobility or technology) /&amp;nbsp;日本のビジネス環境、文化、および規制環境（特にモビリティやテクノロジー分野）に関する深い知識&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in both US and Japanese companies /&amp;nbsp;米国企業および日本企業双方における勤務経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with international market entry, product launches, or scaling a new business /&amp;nbsp;国際市場への参入、プロダクト リリース、または新規事業の拡大に直接携わった経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide travel requirements (if applicable) / 出張について&lt;/strong&gt;（該当する場合）:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel will be required, around 10-20% of time /&amp;nbsp;業務時間の10〜20% 程度の出張が発生する場合があります&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo&#39;s Data Science team is an important part of our mission to develop safe and reliable autonomous driving technology. We use data analysis and leverage statistical expertise to evaluate and improve the Waymo Driver, focusing on areas like reliability, driving quality, and safety. Our work ensures that data-driven insights inform key aspects of Waymo&#39;s development process.&amp;nbsp; As a Business Intelligence Analyst, you will help build the data infrastructure behind reporting and analytics for some core pillars supported by the Waymo Data Science team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Data Analyst, you will leverage advanced SQL and Business Intelligence tools to build state-of-the-art reporting infrastructure (data pipelines, dashboards) to ensure decision making within one of:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Waymo Driving Quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Waymo Safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Waymo Reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write high quality data pipelines with clear definitions to ensure consistency of metrics across the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, define, and govern key performance indicators (KPIs) and core metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Data Science, Engineering, Operations, Product, and Regulatory teams to allow accurate reporting to several audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare content and communicate to Waymo leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run deep analyses into data trends observed to drive partner team goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in a Data Analyst, Business Intelligence Analyst, or similar quantitative role within a tech-forward environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced SQL proficiency – you are an expert at writing high-performance queries, including window functions, UDFs, and complex joins to manipulate large-scale datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Engineering mindset – experience managing and querying extremely large datasets (BigQuery, Redshift, or similar) and building scalable data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Visualization &amp;amp; Storytelling – a proven track record of building intuitive, &quot;executive-ready&quot; dashboards in modern BI tools (e.g., Tableau, Looker, or Data Studio).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure Management – expertise in building and maintaining data infrastructure for large organizations, ensuring a clean separation between development and production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Influence – the ability to translate complex data trends into actionable insights for Engineering, Product, and Leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive Problem Solving – demonstrates the initiative and foresight to identify business needs before they become critical bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
