&lt;li&gt;Oversee proactive and reactive communications related to regulatory issues, ensuring clear and consistent messaging during complex situations. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Policy, Legal, Marketing, and Product teams to develop communications strategy and messaging on a range of issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage ongoing executive communications opportunities, including media briefings, speaking engagements, industry events, and more. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in public relations, media relations, or communications. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
