&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;External Stakeholder Liaison: Lead coordination with local Law Enforcement, First Responders, and Municipal DOTs to standardize how autonomous vehicles are handled during roadside incidents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vendor Performance Management: Manage relationships with third-party recovery partners (3PL), holding them to rigorous service-level agreements (SLAs) regarding response times, safety certifications, and equipment readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Post-Mortem &amp;amp; Data Analysis: Review recovery data to identify &quot;bottleneck&quot; locations and systemic failure trends; provide executive-ready reporting on recovery efficiency and safety compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
