&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Hardware Engineering is an innovative and collaborative group of electrical, mechanical, reliability, software and vehicle engineers. We design, build, and perfect the products which are the eyes and ears of Waymo&#39;s autonomous driving technology, and integrate those products into vehicle platforms. We&#39;re seeking curious and talented teammates to keep us moving in the right direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced Sensor Electrical Engineer to join our Hardware/Sensor team. In this role, you will play a critical part in the full product life cycle—from initial design and development through to mass production—of our advanced sensor technologies. You will collaborate closely with cross-functional partners, including software, mechanical, and manufacturing teams, to deliver innovative and robust engineering solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role follows a hybrid work schedule and reports to the Sensors Hardware Lead.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Product Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate, design, build, and validate next-generation sensor products, managing projects from concept through to mass production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop creative engineering solutions, performing hands-on characterization, debugging, and system validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work in close partnership with software, mechanical, and manufacturing engineering teams to ensure seamless integration and high-quality deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; An MS or PhD in Electrical Engineering or Physics, with at least 3+ years of relevant industry experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; A deep understanding of electrical engineering design, particularly in power supplies and mixed-signal systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools &amp;amp; Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience with simulation, EE CAD tools, and schematic capture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with low-level embedded software and Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic, and evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in electrical engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for hands-on work, spanning both hardware and software domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or interest in developing internal tools and workflows to enhance team productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel periodically to collaborate directly with our manufacturing partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel requirements&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel is required to work with our manufacturing partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$159,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$196,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Hardware Engineering is a diverse, and collaborative group of electrical, mechanical, reliability, software and vehicle engineers. We design, build, and perfect the products which are the eyes and ears of Waymo&#39;s autonomous driving technology, and integrate those products into vehicle platforms. We&#39;re looking for curious and talented teammates to keep us moving in the right direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The Embedded Simulation team enables Waymo to quickly and reliably scale the Waymo Driver across new vehicle &amp;amp; hardware platforms, and to accelerate development of our embedded and reliability software systems. We build both dedicated test properties for embedded and hardware use cases, and also incorporate our technology into full-system behavioral simulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In this role, you will report to the Senior Director, R&amp;amp;D Software Engineering&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &amp;amp; manage team responsible for embedded HIL/SIL testing and simulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set strategy for expansion of test &amp;amp; sim infrastructure to support new products and Waymo&#39;s scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Waymo internal graph-based simulation framework in C++ and improve simulation realism by implementing models of a vehicle and environmental conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combine past logged data with the output of the models running in a loop for a more representative simulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate SIL and HIL simulation with CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure test &amp;amp; sim infrastructure is highly available and reliable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical leadership of software teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of modern C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, implementing and maintaining production software systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux on advanced user level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity in Electrical Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for HIL simulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded programming experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux for real-time applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of general-purpose and automotive network systems (Ethernet, CAN, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the building blocks for datacenter monitoring systems (databases, dashboards, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$281,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$356,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Waymo Safety team works to promote and help to continuously improve the safety of Waymo&#39;s fully autonomous driving technology. Our experts develop safety goals and strategies, and conduct safety engineering analyses to ensure safety is being considered throughout the design and development of our vehicles. The team develops and promotes safety strategies and policies for autonomous vehicles for its work with regulatory authorities, lawmakers, law enforcement and public and non-profit organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Waymo Safety チームは、Waymo の完全自動運転技術の安全性の向上と継続的改善に取り組んでいます。Waymo の専門家は、安全目標と戦略を策定するとともに、安全工学分析を実施し、車両の設計および開発のすべての工程で安全性が考慮されるよう取り組んでいます。チームは、規制当局、立法機関、法執行機関、公共団体、非営利団体と連携するため、自動運転車に関する安全戦略およびポリシーの策定と推進を行っています。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In this role you will be hybrid based in Tokyo and report into our Head of Resilience and Incident Management. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;この役割はロンドンを拠点とするハイブリッド勤務となり、レジリエンスおよびインシデント管理責任者にレポートします。&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will / 業務内容&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a native Japanese speaker, also proficient in English. / 日本語を母語とし、英語にも堪能であること&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain primary contact with Emergency Services at management and executive levels in current and future areas of operation. / 現在および将来のオペレーション領域において、管理職および経営幹部レベルの緊急サービスとの主な連絡窓口を確立し、維持します。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, present, and certify additional Emergency Services Ambassadors (ESAs) and Emergency Services stakeholders on Waymo&#39;s mission, technology, and industry concerns. / Waymo の使命、テクノロジー、業界の懸念事項について、追加の緊急サービス アンバサダー（ESA）および緊急サービス関係者の設計、提示、認定を行います。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide oversight, review, and guidance to Emergency Services training teams and act as the final source of truth for Emergency Services questions. / 緊急サービス トレーニング チームに対して監督、レビュー、指導を行い、緊急サービスに関する質問について最終的な公式見解を示す責任を担います。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Waymo at Emergency Services events, panels, and industry events. / 緊急サービス イベント、パネル ディスカッション、業界イベントで Waymo を代表します。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as Waymo’s on the ground representative during emergency events and coordinate with local emergency services and local authorities. / 緊急事態発生時に Waymo の現地代表として活動し、地域の緊急サービスおよび地方当局と連携します。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have / 必須条件:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of service in Japan’s emergency services (Police, Fire &amp;amp; Rescue, or Ambulance Service) / 日本の緊急サービス（警察、消防および救助、または救急サービス）での 10 年以上の勤務経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of Japan’s legal frameworks, emergency protocols, and community engagement strategies. /&amp;nbsp;日本の法的枠組み、緊急時対応プロトコル、コミュニティ関与戦略に関する深い理解&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills, capable of engaging diverse audiences. /&amp;nbsp;多様な聴衆を惹きつけることのできる、優れたコミュニケーション能力およびプレゼンテーション能力&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of the specific nuances and sensitivities of Emergency Services communities in Japan. / 日本の緊急サービス コミュニティ特有のニュアンスや配慮を深く理解していること&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to establish and maintain a professional presence at executive and command staff levels. /&amp;nbsp;経営幹部および指揮スタッフレベルにおいて、専門的な信頼関係を確立し、維持できる能力&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and the ability to work effectively with legal and other internal teams. / 協調的な姿勢を有し、法務チームやその他の社内チームと効果的に連携できる能力&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer / 歓迎条件:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 7 years in a leadership or management position within one of Japan’s principal emergency services. / 日本の主要な緊急サービス機関のいずれかにおいて、指導的立場または管理職として少なくとも 7 年の実務経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing organizational presence in new geographic locations. / 新しい地域において組織のプレゼンスを確立した経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with autonomous vehicle technology and its implications for emergency services. / 自動運転車技術およびそれが緊急サービスに与える影響に関する知識&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of policy development related to emergency management. / 緊急事態管理に関する政策立案の実績&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a role requiring significant public speaking and stakeholder engagement. / 重要な公の場での発言や利害関係者との関与を必要とする職務の経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in rapidly scaling and complex operational environments. / 急速に拡大する複雑な運用環境での業務経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Travel Requirements / 出張要件:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;~20% travel (Domestic &amp;amp; International) /&amp;nbsp;約 20% の出張（国内および海外）&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please Note: This role works with sensitive content or situations and may be exposed to graphic, controversial, and/or upsetting topics or content. / &lt;strong&gt;注: &lt;/strong&gt;この職務ではデリケートなコンテンツや状況を扱うことがあり、刺激的、物議を醸す、または不快感を伴うトピックやコンテンツに接する可能性があります。&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Waymo Operations exists to deliver the Waymo Driver to the world. We are a global team building and scaling the world&#39;s first and leading autonomous fleet and operations platform. From component sourcing to end customer management, we enable and create value for Waymo through scaled and orchestrated deployment of the Waymo Driver. At Waymo, we are dedicated to building a culture that promotes collaboration and celebration. We value our team members&#39; unique backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences and support and encourage all team members to share their ideas to help Waymo better serve the communities in which we operate.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evolve, lead, and drive world class performance of Waymo’s global B2B partner support model. This scope includes customer support for our Driven By Waymo fleet operator companies who manage and maintain Waymo autonomous vehicles engaged in commercial operation, and also our partner-led car validation testing of new hardware platforms and software builds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build out the support model, design the strategy, align Key Performance Indicators (KPIs). Relentlessly execute with vendor and internal teams to exceed KPIs (including analyzing metric performance misses, developing process fixes, leverage the best 3P and internal technical solutions available (in partnership with Waymo’s engineering teams), influencing tool roadmap fixes, and driving metric success). This role is a mix of strategic design and daily, hands-on operations work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate and drive the evolution of the program, ensuring the support model scales effectively with Waymo and our partner network to integrate new partner business models. This will include collaboration with our partner management team and partners themselves to understand their operational workflows and pain points. This will require onsite travel to locations where partner support is conducted, both domestically and internationally, to learn the operations of the business. This will also require assessing and planning for upcoming growth in Waymo partner programs. You will bring a background leveraging tooling solutions to optimize support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the cadence of communications on program health and status with key stakeholders. Exhibit excellent communication skills, including: building polished decks and communications for an executive audience, taking detailed daily work and upleveling it for internal and external consumption and action, designing standard operating procedures to drive operational excellence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act always as an accountable owner. Own the operational outcomes of this program. Own the strategy and the execution for Waymo partners and internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8 years of experience in B2B/Enterprise-level customer/partner support as a vendor manager or program manager, preferably in the transportation and/or autonomous vehicle space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of implementing improvements in a complex program, both as an individual contributor and as a member of a team or as a supervisor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence external partners and cross-functional stakeholders (Engineering, Product, Operations) to achieve strategic goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management expertise and demonstrated experience and impact with past projects and programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s degree or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A master&#39;s degree in a relevant technical or business field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in leading B2B support in a high growth company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience directly improving an operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certification or deep experience in operational methodologies, such as ITIL. Certification or expertise in project management, such as PMP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$190,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$241,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Waymo Operations exists to deliver the Waymo Driver to the world. We are a global team building and scaling the world&#39;s first and leading autonomous fleet and operations platform. From component sourcing to end customer management, we enable and create value for Waymo through scaled and orchestrated deployment of the Waymo Driver. At Waymo, we are dedicated to building a culture that promotes collaboration and celebration. We value our team members&#39; unique backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences and support and encourage all team members to share their ideas to help Waymo better serve the communities in which we operate. &lt;strong&gt;W&lt;/strong&gt;aymo Operations は、Waymo Driver を世界に届けることを使命としています。私たちは、世界初となる大型の自動運転フリートおよびオペレーション プラットフォームを構築し、スケーリングするグローバル チームです。部品調達からエンド カスタマーの管理まで、Waymo Driver を大規模かつ組織的に展開することで Waymo の価値を実現・創造します。Waymo は、協働と称賛を促す文化の構築に尽力しています。私たちはチームメンバーの独自の背景、視点、経験を尊重し、Waymo が事業を展開する地域社会にさらに貢献していけるよう、すべてのメンバーがアイデアを共有することをサポートし、奨励しています。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;In this hybrid role, you will report to a Head of Event Responce&amp;nbsp; エスカレーション マネージャーはハイブリッドな職種であり、イベント対応責任者の直属となります。&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will: 業務内容:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical Escalation Leadership: Serve as the primary incident leader and escalation point for high-priority safety and operational issues. Make real-time, safety-driven judgment calls regarding fleet and rider issues to protect the community and general public. Resolve complex situations under pressure by balancing risk, safety, and operational continuity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;重大なエスカレーションにおけるリーダーシップ: 優先度の高い安全および運用上の問題に関して、一次事故対応リーダーおよびエスカレーション窓口としての役割を担う。地域社会と一般市民を守るため、フリートや乗客に関する問題について、安全性を重視したリアルタイムの判断を下す。リスク、安全性、オペレーション継続性のバランスを取りながら、プレッシャーのかかる状況下で複雑な問題を解決する。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Coordination: Partner with local leadership, Engineering, and Safety to direct immediate response actions and ensure business continuity. Act as the &quot;single source of truth,&quot; providing authoritative updates and clear communication to executive stakeholders. Lead Operations teams in the swift execution of escalation pathways and response plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;部門横断的な連携: 現場のリーダー、エンジニアリング部門、安全部門と連携して、対応策を迅速に示し、ビジネスの継続性を確保する。「信頼できる唯一の情報源」となり、経営幹部クラスのステークホルダーに対し、信頼できる最新情報と明確なコミュニケーションを提供する。オペレーション チームを率いて、エスカレーション手順と対応計画を迅速に実行する。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incident Review &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement: Lead structured post-incident reviews to identify root causes and translate findings into updated playbooks and workflows. Analyze recurring trends to propose system improvements and provide technical feedback to product and quality teams. Manage daily and weekly reporting for significant events, ensuring rigorous follow-up and corrective action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;インシデント レビューと継続的改善: インシデント発生後の体系的なレビューを主導し、根本原因を特定し、その結果を反映してハンドブックとワークフローを更新する。繰り返し発生する傾向を分析し、システム改善案を提案するとともに、プロダクト チームや品質チームに技術的なフィードバックを提供する。重大な事象に関して日次および週次でレポートし、厳格なフォローアップと是正措置を確実に実施する。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Excellence &amp;amp; Technical Knowledge Retention: Standardize escalation frameworks and decision playbooks to ensure consistency across all markets and partners. Maintain in-house technical knowledge retention and ensure strict compliance with safety and regulatory standards. Coordinate product releases with vendor teams, managing change management and performance tracking for new capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;効率的な運用と技術知識の維持: エスカレーション フレームワークと意思決定ハンドブックを標準化し、すべての市場やパートナーの間で一貫性を確保する。社内における技術知識の維持管理を行い、安全基準および規制基準を厳守する。ベンダーチームと連携してプロダクト リリースを調整し、新機能のチェンジ マネジメントとパフォーマンス トラッキングを行う。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Safety Culture Building: Model composure and decisive leadership while managing high-pressure, critical incidents.Champion a culture of safety and accountability across internal teams and vendor partners. Serve as a trusted advisor to leadership and a mentor to frontline teams during and after escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;リーダーシップと安全を重視する文化の構築: 高いプレッシャーのかかる重大な事案に対処する際に、冷静さと決断力のあるリーダーシップを発揮する。社内チームおよびベンダー パートナー全体で、安全と説明責任の文化を推進する。経営陣にとって信頼できるアドバイザーとして、また、エスカレーション発生時および発生後に現場チームのメンターとして貢献する。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have: 必須条件:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree (or 4+ years equivalent experience) with a proven background in high-pressure environments such as aviation, emergency response, or critical infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;経験と学歴: &lt;/strong&gt;学士号（または 4 年以上の同等の経験）を取得しており、航空、緊急対応、重要インフラなどの高プレッシャー環境での業務遂行経験があること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Stakes Decision Making:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery in real-time critical thinking and de-escalation, with the emotional intelligence to prioritize safety and operational continuity during complex incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;高リスクの意思決定: &lt;/strong&gt;複雑な事案の発生時に、安全とオペレーションの継続を優先するための感情的知性を備え、リアルタイムの批判的思考と沈静化に習熟していること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional verbal and written skills, with the ability to provide authoritative direction to cross-functional teams and deliver concise briefings to executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;経営幹部とのコミュニケーション: &lt;/strong&gt;口頭、書面での優れたコミュニケーション能力を持ち、部門横断的なチームに信頼できる指示を提供し、経営幹部に簡潔なブリーフィングを行う能力があること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Leadership &amp;amp; Technical Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated skill in leading post-incident reviews, translating data-driven trends into actionable playbooks, and navigating complex workflow management software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;インシデント リーダーシップと技術的熟練度: &lt;/strong&gt;インシデント後のレビューを主導し、データに基づいて分析した傾向を実行可能なハンドブックに反映し、複雑なワークフロー管理ソフトウェアを操作するスキルを実証できること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt; Bilingual fluency in Japanese and English, with the flexibility to work a 24/7 rotating shift schedule including nights, weekends, and holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;業務要件: &lt;/strong&gt;日本語と英語の両方に堪能で、夜間、週末、祝日を含む 24 時間 365 日の交代勤務スケジュールに柔軟に対応できること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&amp;nbsp;歓迎条件:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Emergency Operations Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience leading command center or emergency dispatch operations, ideally supported by an Emergency Telecommunications certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;緊急オペレーションのリーダーシップ: &lt;/strong&gt;指令センターまたは緊急通報業務を主導した実績があり、理想的には緊急通信の認定を受けていること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public Safety Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Previous experience in law enforcement or emergency services with specialized training in de-escalation and managing high-distress scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;公共安全の経歴: &lt;/strong&gt;法執行機関または緊急サービスの経験が過去にあり、事態の沈静化と高ストレス シナリオのマネジメントに関する専門的なトレーニングを受けていること。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Context:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior exposure to the autonomous vehicle (AV) or rideshare industries is a significant plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;業界に関する状況: &lt;/strong&gt;自律走行車両（AV）またはライドシェア業界での経験は大きなプラスになります。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel: &lt;strong&gt;出張要件&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will require 15% travel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;チーム ミーティング、ベンダー訪問、その他のオペレーション ニーズに応じて、最大 15%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Waymo Operations exists to deliver the Waymo Driver to the world. We are a global team building and scaling the world&#39;s first and leading autonomous fleet and operations platform. From component sourcing to end customer management, we enable and create value for Waymo through scaled and orchestrated deployment of the Waymo Driver. At Waymo, we are dedicated to building a culture that promotes collaboration and celebration. We value our team members&#39; unique backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences and support and encourage all team members to share their ideas to help Waymo better serve the communities in which we operate.&lt;/p&gt;
