&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wherever Waymo works, Business Support teams are on the job. We&#39;re the partners who plan events, work with external partners, and orchestrate the daily activities of our teams and leaders, the real estate specialists who find and build amazing workspaces and research facilities; the systems experts who develop and run our intuitive IT and business tools. Together, we do everything it takes to keep Waymo rolling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report into Executive Team Leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic CEO Partnership: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You use superior judgment and independent discretion paired with a deep understanding of the business to act as a strategic partner to the CEO. You proactively manage the CEO’s time, resolve complex scheduling conflicts, and prioritize critical business initiatives to ensure focus on the most impactful decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Office Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Strategically manage the administrative landscape (calendars, travel, complex logistics) to focus the CEO on high-level priorities. Your attention to detail ensures the CEO is always prepared for meetings, board engagements, and external presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as a central force for the CEO’s office, optimizing processes, streamlining workflows, and fostering seamless cross-functional collaboration. Challenge the status quo to build efficiency into existing operations and shape new strategies for rapid growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System-Wide Connectivity: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as a critical liaison, building strong relationships across Waymo, Google, and Alphabet, and with external partners. Proactively identify and solve roadblocks to keep the CEO’s office connected and effective within the broader ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABP Leadership:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You are a driver of excellence who sets the standard for all ABPs within Waymo.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience providing direct executive support to C-suite executives within a fast-paced technology or startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex scheduling and logistics with external partners, demonstrating responsiveness, flexibility, and sound judgment with confidentiality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational, time management, and prioritization skills with the ability to manage multiple complex tasks in a dynamic setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills: Proven ability to build strong relationships, collaborate effectively across diverse teams/functions, and maintain strict confidentiality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen, analytical problem-solving skills, and the ability to adapt effectively to different leadership styles and partnership dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI-scheduling agents and LLM-based productivity tools to automate meeting summaries, action items, and data synthesis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead projects, manage processes, and independently resolve operational issues through strategic thinking and data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic ability to use tools like Tableau, Looker, or advanced Excel/Sheets to visualize data for executive presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert proficiency in the Google Office Suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$158,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$194,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;On the Waymo Marketing team, you will help to connect people with the magic and impact of Waymo&#39;s autonomous driving technology. Our team has the unique opportunity to not only grow Waymo&#39;s brand from the ground up, but to also build societal acceptance for autonomous driving technology for the first time in history. We build thoughtful marketing strategy, positioning, messaging and creative assets to deliver messages that matter to our audience, communicated through anything from video content, to social media interactions, to immersive physical experiences. We also shape Waymo&#39;s go-to-market initiatives, helping to transform Waymo into a thriving business with a growing user base. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report to the Experiential Marketing Lead.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end lifecycle of large-scale experiential initiatives and programs, translating Waymo’s brand mission into immersive consumer experiences that build public trust in autonomous technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage program budgets with attention to detail, optimizing resource allocation and vendor negotiations to deliver premium activations with high cost-efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive collaboration between Product, Marketing, and Operations teams, providing direction to internal staff and external partners to ensure seamless execution of event logistics and management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a diverse network of creative support including internal and external agencies and vendors to deliver world-class experiences for Waymo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to&amp;nbsp; KPI frameworks and measurement strategies to evaluate event/campaign impact, delivering actionable insights and ROI reports to the Experiential Lead, Head of Marketing and CMO audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years experience leading high-impact experiential marketing or brand activations, ideally within a high growth tech company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s degree or an equivalent combination of advanced education and professional experience in Marketing, Communications, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of architecting end-to-end brand activations, demonstrating the ability to translate complex organizational missions into immersive consumer narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional project management capabilities, with experience leading by influencing across cross-functional stakeholders, manage agencies, contractors and orchestrate collaboration across internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional project management and organizational skills, with a focus on architecting robust workflows that ensure the seamless execution of initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a fast-paced, high-growth environment, with prior experience in consumer technology, transportation, Experience in the autonomous vehicle, mobility, or a similarly highly regulated, pioneering technology sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with in-house creative development processes, with a strong creative judgment and ability to maintain consistent brand voice across all touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event ROI tracking, RFID lead retrieval, or post-event sentiment analysis tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30% travel, as events require&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$177,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$218,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Waymo Safety team works to promote and help to continuously improve the safety of Waymo&#39;s fully autonomous driving technology. Our experts develop safety goals and strategies, and conduct safety engineering analyses to ensure safety is being considered throughout the design and development of our vehicles. The team develops and promotes safety strategies and policies for autonomous vehicles for its work with regulatory authorities, lawmakers, law enforcement and public and non-profit organizations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Waymo Safety チームは、Waymo の完全自動運転技術の安全性の向上と継続的改善に取り組んでいます。Waymo の専門家は、安全目標と戦略を策定するとともに、安全工学分析を実施し、車両の設計および開発のすべての工程で安全性が考慮されるよう取り組んでいます。チームは、規制当局、立法機関、法執行機関、公共団体、非営利団体と連携するため、自動運転車に関する安全戦略およびポリシーの策定と推進を行っています。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Tokyo, reporting to Waymo’s Senior Director, Safety based in California. As Waymo’s first Field Safety Engineer in Japan, you will serve as Waymo’s primary engineering/technical liaison with safety regulators in Japan, working closely with Waymo’s Policy, Legal, and other teams in Japan. You will also work with Waymo’s Field Safety team in the United States to identify and analyze issues that could impact the safety of Waymo’s fleet of autonomous vehicles, with a focus on issues specific to Waymo’s operations in Japan.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;この役職は東京を拠点とし、カリフォルニアを拠点とする Waymo のシニア ディレクター（セーフティ）にレポートします。Waymo の日本における最初のフィールド セーフティ エンジニアとして、日本の Waymo のポリシー、法務、その他のチームと緊密に連携しながら、日本の安全規制当局に対する Waymo の主要なエンジニアリング / 技術連絡窓口として業務を行います。また、米国の Waymo のフィールド セーフティ チームと連携し、日本での Waymo のオペレーションに特有の課題に焦点を当てながら、Waymo の自動運転車フリートの安全性に影響を及ぼす可能性のある問題を特定し、分析します。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will / 業務内容&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a native Japanese speaker, also proficient in English /&amp;nbsp;日本語を母語とし、英語にも堪能であること&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as Waymo’s primary engineering/technical liaison with automotive and traffic safety regulators in Japan, e.g. Ministry of Land, Infrastructure, Transport, and Tourism (MLIT) National Police Agency (NPA), and Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department (TMPD). You will work with Waymo’s Policy, Legal, and other teams to establish and maintain proactive outreach with these regulators and also respond to requests from regulators. / 国土交通省（MLIT）、警察庁（NPA）、警視庁（TMPD）など、日本の自動車および交通安全規制当局に対する Waymo の主要なエンジニアリング / 技術連絡窓口を務めます。Waymo のポリシー、法務、その他のチームと連携し、これらの規制当局との積極的な連携関係を確立および維持するとともに、規制当局からの要請にも対応します。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work with Waymo’s Field Safety team in the United States to identify and analyze issues that could impact the safety of Waymo’s fleet of autonomous vehicles, bringing your local Japan perspective to help identify and prioritize issues that could impact Waymo’s operations in Japan. / 米国の Waymo のフィールド セーフティ チームと連携して、Waymo の自動運転車フリートの安全性に影響を及ぼす可能性のある問題を特定して分析するとともに、日本に関する知見を活かして、日本での Waymo のオペレーションに影響する課題を特定し、優先順位付けを行います。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have / 必須条件&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor of Science in Engineering, Computer Science, or a related technical degree / 工学、コンピュータ サイエンス、または関連する技術分野の学士号&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of engineering or other technical experience in automotive or another transportation field. / 自動車またはその他の輸送分野における 10 年以上のエンジニアリングまたはその他の技術分野での経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Japan’s automotive and/or transportation regulatory framework and familiarity with expectations when working with these regulators. / 日本の自動車および / または運輸分野の規制の枠組みに関する経験、ならびにこれらの規制当局と連携する際の期待事項への理解&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills in Japanese and the ability to establish and maintain professional presence with regulators in Japan. / 日本語での優れたコミュニケーション能力およびプレゼンテーション能力、ならびに日本の規制当局との専門的な関係を確立し維持できる能力&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and the ability to work effectively with Policy, Legal, Operations, Engineering and other internal teams in Japan and in the United States. / 協調的な姿勢を有し、日本および米国のポリシー、法務、オペレーション、エンジニアリングなどの社内チームと効果的に連携できる能力&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Prefer /&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;歓迎条件&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;M.S. or Ph.D. in engineering or a related technical field / 工学または関連する技術分野の修士号または博士号&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience interacting with automotive and traffic safety regulators. / 自動車および交通安全規制当局とのやり取りの経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with autonomous vehicle technology / 自動運転技術に関する知識&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a fast-paced, rapidly-scaling company / 急速に成長しているスピード感のある企業での勤務経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Travel requirements / &amp;nbsp;出張要件&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 20% travel (Domestic &amp;amp; International) / 約 20% の出張（国内および海外）&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Waymo Operations exists to deliver the Waymo Driver to the world. We are a global team building and scaling the world&#39;s first and leading autonomous fleet and operations platform. From component sourcing to end customer management, we enable and create value for Waymo through scaled and orchestrated deployment of the Waymo Driver. At Waymo, we are dedicated to building a culture that promotes collaboration and celebration. We value our team members&#39; unique backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences and support and encourage all team members to share their ideas to help Waymo better serve the communities in which we operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report to a Fleet Manager&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Campaign Planning &amp;amp; Readiness: Define campaign scope, objectives, and success metrics; build end-to-end execution plans including timelines, market sequencing, and capacity needs; conduct go or nogo readiness reviews across parts, tooling, labor, and SOP readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Cross-Functional Execution: Partner with Engineering, Supply Chain, Infrastructure, and Operations to coordinate campaign delivery, assign ownership across workstreams, manage dependencies and blockers, and oversee in-market execution to meet timelines, quality, throughput and cost targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protect Fleet Availability &amp;amp; Scale Best Practices: Monitor fleet availability impact, implement guardrails to minimize operational disruption, adjust plans in real time based on capacity or demand constraints, and develop standardized playbooks and documentation for repeatable global rollout success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Technical Readiness &amp;amp; Field Deployment Success: Partner with Engineering to convert technical fixes into executable field actions, validate tools/parts/procedures, lead pilot launches to identify gaps, and ensure field teams are trained and launch-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Performance Monitoring &amp;amp; Issue Resolution: Track campaign KPIs including completion rates, throughput, downtime impact, and defect resolution; deliver regular status reporting; serve as the central escalation point to rapidly resolve risks impacting timelines or fleet performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Continuous Improvement &amp;amp; Scalable Operations: Lead post-campaign reviews, capture lessons learned across process, tooling, and capacity, update playbooks and frameworks, and build repeatable execution models for future large-scale initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience as a Technical Program Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of managing multiple complex programs where precision, attention to detail, and cost control management are critical to success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross functional stakeholder management- experience driving cross-functional technical programs within Operations or Fleet Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication and executive presence- strong leadership skills, and clear verbal and written communication, alongside the ability to navigate ambiguity and drive decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; KPI driven mindset - strong experience building dashboards, tracking KPI&#39;s, and interpreting operational data, and using martics to drive decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process improvement and standardization- experience developing playbooks, SOP&#39;s, scalable frameworks, and continious improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise within the autonomous vehicle or automotive industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaign or roll out execution expertise&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in OEM/service operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$159,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$196,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Waymo Operations exists to deliver the Waymo Driver to the world. We are a global team building and scaling the world&#39;s first and leading autonomous fleet and operations platform. From component sourcing to end customer management, we enable and create value for Waymo through scaled and orchestrated deployment of the Waymo Driver. At Waymo, we are dedicated to building a culture that promotes collaboration and celebration. We value our team members&#39; unique backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences and support and encourage all team members to share their ideas to help Waymo better serve the communities in which we operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report to the Head of Fleet Development and Service Quality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Waymo Operations は、Waymo Driver を世界に届けるための存在です。私たちは、世界初かつ最先端の自律走行車両および運用プラットフォームを構築し、拡大するグローバル チームです。部品調達からエンド カスタマー管理まで、Waymo Driver の大規模かつオーケストレーションされた展開を通じて Waymo の価値を実現し、創造します。Waymo は、協働と称賛を促進する文化の構築に注力しています。チームメンバーの独自の背景、視点、経験を重視し、Waymo が事業を展開するコミュニティにさらに貢献できるよう、すべてのチームメンバーがアイデアを共有することをサポートし、奨励しています。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;フリート開発およびサービス品質責任者の直属として、こうしたハイブリッドな役割を担っていただきます。&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will: 業務内容&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Act as the primary point of contact for partner-led fleet service operations, cultivating strong, collaborative relationships and ensuring alignment with Waymo’s operational standards, policies, and strategic objectives;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;強固なパートナーシップの構築: パートナー主導のフリート サービス運用の主な連絡窓口として機能し、強固で協働的な関係を構築するとともに、Waymo の運用基準、ポリシー、戦略目標との整合性を確保します。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate the exchange of insights and best practices between Waymo’s operations and partner’s, fostering continuous fleet health and workshop efficiency improvements; 全社的なコラボレーションの推進: Waymo のオペレーションとパートナー間でインサイトおよびベストプラクティスの共有を促進し、フリートの健全性とワークショップの効率性の継続的な向上を推進します。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and scale initial fleet service, maintenance, and repair operations in new markets;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;新規市場の開拓: 新規市場において、フリート サービス、メンテナンス、修理業務の初期体制を確立し、拡大します。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide and manage a team of diagnostic technicians, setting priorities and ensuring effective task execution;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;診断技術者の指導と支援: 診断技術者チームを指導および管理し、優先順位を設定するとともに、効果的なタスク実行を支援します。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Operations leads to guarantee cross-market operational consistency and robustly deploy procedural and technological changes; グローバルな整合性の確保: オペレーション リードと連携し、市場間での運用の一貫性を担保するとともに、手順および技術の変更を確実に展開します。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide performance updates and insights to Operations leadership which drive improvement and ensure accountability, 分析とレポーティング: オペレーションのリーダーシップに対し、改善を促進し説明責任を確保するためのパフォーマンスの更新情報と分析情報を提供します。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have: 応募資格&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Bilingual - competent speaking and writing both Japanese and English; バイリンガル - 日本語と英語の両方で会話と書き取りが可能な方&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a commercial operations and logistics role with a focus on fleet readiness initiatives;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;自動車関連のオペレーションまたはプログラム管理の職務における 5 年以上の経験&lt;/li&gt;
