&lt;li&gt;Drive fleet readiness across a portfolio of emerging markets, ensuring the AV fleet meets stringent performance benchmarks and &quot;ready-for-service&quot; standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor a team of Diagnostic Technicians, setting daily priorities and ensuring high-quality execution of complex sensor and EV powertrain calibrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage complex service-level agreements (SLAs) while ensuring third-party partners are appropriately staffed and technically trained to support multi-platform EV operations. Experience auditing vendor &quot;Standard Work&quot; and safety certifications is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement proactive strategies to maintain the health of an electric ride-hail fleet, collaborating cross-functionally to resolve charging, battery, and hardware infrastructure gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor real-time fleet health metrics to identify systemic issues, implementing rapid-response corrective actions in partnership with internal engineering and external vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strict adherence to established processes and provide high-level performance insights and executive-ready reporting to Global Fleet Leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ Years of Specialized Experience: Proven track record in commercial operations or logistics with a primary focus on large-scale fleet readiness or AV/EV maintenance programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience managing or scaling electric vehicle fleets, including an understanding of high-voltage systems, charging infrastructure, and thermal management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage complex service-level agreements (SLAs), driving vendor performance through data-driven accountability and standard work audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in driving daily operational tasks in a high-velocity environment, consistently meeting or exceeding fleet uptime and NRR (Non-Road Ready) targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple technical projects simultaneously, ensuring high-quality outcomes and timely delivery within a rapidly evolving industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to interpret complex datasets to identify operational gaps, mitigate risks, and make informed decisions that impact market-level economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced skills in risk assessment and long-term prioritization, with the ability to build &quot;safety valve&quot; contingencies for fleet operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in fostering cross-functional alignment between Ops, GPS (Global Operations &amp;amp; Property Services), and external hardware partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of elevating technical teams through structured guidance, clear objective setting, and a &quot;lead-by-example&quot; mentorship style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in identifying potential hardware or infrastructure challenges before they impact service, developing comprehensive remediation steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate high-level organizational goals into actionable field strategies that inspire and motivate both internal and vendor teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the autonomous vehicle ecosystem, including the intersection of software deployment cycles and physical fleet maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
