&lt;li&gt;A BS in Mechanical Engineering, or a similar discipline. MS or MBA are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with multiple commodity types and manufacturing processes such as plastic injection molding for cosmetic and structural applications, die casting, metal stamping and forming, CNC machining, weldments, assemblies, wire harnesses, and cleaning systems and components.&lt;/li&gt;
