&lt;p&gt;Ensure rapid collection, triage, analysis, and dissemination of intelligence across a 24/7 operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead Incident Intelligence: Maintain situational awareness during events and brief leadership with timely, actionable risk insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop Playbooks and Protocols: Create structured, repeatable intelligence workflows that support consistent response and escalation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;10+ years in operational intelligence, risk, or mission‑critical operations in fast‑paced, 24/7 environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to build and scale multi‑source signal‑detection programs (telemetry, threat intel, social/OSINT).&lt;/p&gt;
