&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead program enablement&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead the rollout of new initiatives (e.g. ACED Performance Reviews, Compensation Planning) for your function, ensuring rigor, accuracy, and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach managers&lt;/strong&gt;: Coach experienced managers through crucial and tough conversations, performance management friction, and team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as a trusted interface&lt;/strong&gt;: Serve as the senior &quot;face of HR&quot; for critical manager populations, acting as the primary escalation point for sensitive issues and high-stakes relationship management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate People insights&lt;/strong&gt;: Feed ground intelligence on culture and sentiment to senior leaders and People Business Partners to inform broader strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in HR, People Operations, or Business Partnering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience coaching managers through complex people challenges, including performance management and employee relations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational excellence with a track record of leading complex cycles (e.g. Performance, Compensation) with high attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
