&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with internal teams, including brand marketing, product marketing, communications, and brand engagement, to ensure alignment and consistency across all marketing efforts &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate, schedule, and supervise on-site video shoots, ensuring strict adherence to project timelines and high quality standards &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
