&lt;li&gt;Work with other PMs and cross functional teams to identify the long term product focus areas, and steer technology and engineering efforts to address them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thoroughly investigate data from real-world miles collected by our fleet, define requirements and guide the team to make the right trade-offs between capability, engineering complexity and other factors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align and work cross-functionally with Product Managers, Operations, System Engineering, and other Waymo teams to bring to market products that save lives and transform transportation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
