&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field Engagement: This role requires regular regional travel&amp;nbsp; throughout Texas to represent Waymo at community events, partner meetings, and neighborhood forums. This includes supporting a variety of evening and weekend commitments. Estimated 2x a year back to Waymo HQ in California.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
