&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BS degree in Computer Science or equivalent practical experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of backend/infra experience\&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong knowledge in building software applications at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TL or technical leadership skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
