&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Design at Waymo is about the total experience, not just how the product looks, but how it works, how it feels, and how we make our new technology accessible, approachable, and useful for everyone. We design the intuitive, delightful experience for our riders, and we also build the powerful, complex tools used by our fleet operations teams and the engineers who build the Waymo Driver. We are a highly multidisciplinary team of UX Designers, User and Market Researchers, UX Engineers, Content Designers, Industrial Designers, CAD Designers, Studio Engineers, and Technical Artists. We dig deep to understand the attitudes, emotions, and behaviors of all our users. This understanding serves as the foundation for everything we create.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role follows a hybrid work schedule and you will report to a Studio Engineering Manager.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of high-quality 3D CAD models from initial concept sketches and Industrial Design proposals through to final, production-intent Class-A surfaces. Utilize appropriate fidelity CAD design processes to drive efficient design development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Industrial Designers, Hardware Engineers, and Manufacturing teams to translate design intent into feasible, high-quality surfaces that meet all product and engineering requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support preparation of appropriate CAD files for 3D visualization, and manage digital and physical prototyping workflows (e.g., 3D printing, CNC) to verify form, function, and assembly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and solve complex surfacing and geometry challenges, navigating technical constraints while upholding the highest standards of design quality and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional automotive experience as a CAD Designer, 3D Modeler, or Digital Sculptor in a product-driven environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level proficiency in Class-A surfacing tools using Alias. Strong understanding of quality CAD building strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of delivering high-quality 3D data for mass production, with a deep understanding of manufacturing processes, materials, and assemblies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio demonstrating exceptional technical skill, meticulous attention to detail, and successfully shipped products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Industrial Design, Transportation Design, or a related technical field, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for complex, integrated hardware systems (e.g., robotics, aerospace, advanced consumer electronics)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with CNC programming, advanced 3D printing, or other rapid prototyping methods. Experience working with model shops to create looks-like, feels-like model assets like marketing show cars.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-2 times a quarter (less than 15%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$196,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$248,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As part of Waymo&#39;s Legal team, you will work on the exciting legal issues surrounding our transformational autonomous driving technology and help drive our business lines forward from technology ideation through scaled commercial deployment.&amp;nbsp; We partner with our public policy, safety, security and privacy experts to define transportation policy for the autonomous driving world to come, advising on regulatory changes that support and protect our users around the world.&amp;nbsp; We collaborate with our engineering, product, strategy and operations teams to develop and protect our intellectual property portfolio and drive our corporate and commercial transactions. We ensure compliance with an increasingly complex and dynamic range of global regulations. And we anticipate, mitigate, and litigate high-profile and precedent-setting legal matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Waymo の法務チームの一員として、Waymo の革新的な自動運転技術をめぐる法的問題に取り組み、技術構想から大規模な商用展開まで、各事業ラインを牽引していただきます。Waymo は公共政策、安全、セキュリティ、プライバシーの専門家と提携して、自動運転における交通政策を定義するとともに、世界中のユーザーをサポートし保護するための規制改正について提言を行います。また、エンジニアリングやプロダクト、戦略、運用の各チームと協力して、知的財産ポートフォリオの構築および保護、企業間、商取引の推進を担います。複雑化し、変化し続けるグローバルな規制へのコンプライアンスを確実なものとし、注目度が高く先例となるような法的案件を予見および軽減し、訴訟対応を通じて解決へと導きます。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In this hybrid role you will report directly to our Managing Counsel.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;こうしたハイブリッドな職責を担う業務内容は以下のとおりです。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will / 業務内容:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as lead attorney on a wide range of Japan and greater APAC related projects, and provide the full range of supporting legal services to other global Legal teams, including commercial deals, advocacy, event response, employment, and dispute resolution, in support of Waymo’s success in the region. / 日本および広域アジア太平洋地域の主任弁護士として、関連する幅広いプロジェクトを統括する。同地域における Waymo の成功をサポートするため、商取引、アドボカシー、イベント事案、雇用、紛争解決など、他のグローバル法務チームに包括的な法的サービスを提供する。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic guidance to key cross-functional internal stakeholders on a wide range of legal, business, corporate strategy and governance issues relevant to Japan and the greater APAC region. / 日本および広域アジア太平洋地域に関連する法務、ビジネス、経営戦略、ガバナンスの広範な論点について、社内の主要な部門横断的なステークホルダーに戦略的ガイダンスを提示する。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with key partners such as public policy, public affairs, product counsels, regulatory counsels, communications, compliance and others to jointly develop and implement winning strategies, including representing Waymo in interactions with local agencies and organizations as required. / 公共政策、広報、プロダクト担当顧問、規制担当顧問、コミュニケーション、コンプライアンスなどの主要なパートナーと緊密に連携する。「勝てる戦略」を共同で策定、実行し、必要に応じて現地の行政機関や団体との折衝において Waymo を代理する。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cross-functional global teams with navigating country/region specific laws and regulations, including&amp;nbsp; coordinating internally and externally to closely monitor, review, report on, and shape changing laws and regulations in Japan and the greater APAC region relevant to Waymo’s business. / 社内外の調整を通じて、日本および広域アジア太平洋地域における Waymo の事業に関連する法規制の動向を綿密に注視、把握、報告、形成することで、グローバルチームが各国の固有法や規制を遵守できるようサポートを行う。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain subject matter expertise in new areas as novel regional issues and topics emerge. / 地域の新たな課題やトピックの発生にあわせて、新しい領域の専門知識を習得する。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support compliance and other corporate governance tasks related to Japan and the greater APAC region. / 日本および広域アジア太平洋地域におけるコンプライアンス維持、およびその他のコーポレート ガバナンス業務を支援する。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have / 必要な条件/経験:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Law degree (LLB, LLM or JD) / 法学の学位（LLB、LLM、または JD）&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Admitted to practice law in Japan / 日本における弁護士資格&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 8 years of experience practicing law, 4 of which involve practicing law in Japan / 8 年以上の法務実務経験。うち 4 年は日本国内での実務に従事していること&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience assisting international technology companies with introducing novel products and services into Japan and other APAC countries / 国際的なテック企業において、日本および広域アジア太平洋地域への新製品やサービスの導入を支援した経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging Japanese and other APAC regulators on a range of topics / 多岐にわたるテーマにおいて、日本および広域アジア太平洋地域の規制当局と交渉した経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Japanese and English / 日本語と英語が堪能であること&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer / 望ましい経験/スキル:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in the automotive industry or ride-hailing industry / 自動車業界または配車サービス業界での実務経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working as an in house counsel / 社内弁護士としての実務経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additionally admitted to practice law in another country&amp;nbsp; / 日本以外の国において弁護士活動の認可を取得していること&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in one or more additional languages spoken in the APAC region / アジア太平洋地域で使用されている言語（ 1 つ以上）に堪能であること&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 15 years of experience practicing law / 15 年以上の法務実務経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience working with international legal teams and clients / グローバルな法務チームやクライアントと連携し、成果を上げた実績&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Requirements / 出張について&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel required, primarily within APAC and occasionally to the US / 出張が発生します（主にアジア太平洋地域内、必要に応じて米国）&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As part of Waymo&#39;s Legal team, you will work on the exciting legal issues surrounding our transformational autonomous driving technology and help drive our business lines forward from technology ideation through scaled commercial deployment.&amp;nbsp; We partner with our public policy, safety, security and privacy experts to define transportation policy for the autonomous driving world to come, advising on regulatory changes that support and protect our users around the world.&amp;nbsp; We collaborate with our engineering, product, strategy and operations teams to develop and protect our intellectual property portfolio and drive our corporate and commercial transactions. We ensure compliance with an increasingly complex and dynamic range of global regulations. And we anticipate, mitigate, and litigate high-profile and precedent-setting legal matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Waymo の法務チームの一員として、Waymo の革新的な自動運転技術を取り巻く興味深い法的問題に取り組み、技術構想から大規模な商用展開まで、Waymo の事業部門の推進に貢献していただきます。Waymo は、公共政策、安全、セキュリティ、プライバシーの専門家と提携して、将来の自動運転の世界における交通政策を定義し、世界中のユーザーをサポートし保護する規制の改正について助言します。エンジニアリング、製品、戦略、運用の各チームと連携して、知的財産ポートフォリオを開発、保護し、企業取引および商取引を推進しています。ますます複雑化し、変化し続ける世界的な規制への準拠を保証します。また、注目度が高く先例となるような法的問題を予測して軽減し、訴訟を起こします&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this hybrid role you will report directly to our Managing Counsel - Regulatory, Policy, Product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;規制、ポリシー、製品担当マネージング カウンセルの直属として、こうしたハイブリッドな役割を担っていただきます。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will / 業務内容:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop vision, strategy, and implementation for complying with a range of regulations - this includes interpreting legacy legal and regulatory frameworks that didn’t contemplate our novel technology and advising on new laws and regulations developed with AVs and related emerging technology in mind. / さまざまな規制を遵守するためのビジョン、戦略、実装計画を策定します。これには、Waymo の新技術を想定していない従来の法律や規制の枠組みを解釈し、自動運転車および関連の新興技術を考慮して新たに規定される法律と規制について助言することが含まれます。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on matters at the local, state, federal, and international levels, with an emphasis on Japan&amp;nbsp; (e.g. requirements to operate on public roads; legislative review and drafting of proposed legislation and regulations). / 日本を主な対象として、地域、都道府県、全国、国際レベルの諸問題（公道での運行要件や、法律と規制の草案作成や法的審査など）について助言します。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage in cross-functional planning efforts to ensure that regulatory compliance and strategy are properly incorporated into the project roadmap. / 部門を横断した計画立案作業に従事し、規制遵守に関する計画と戦略をプロジェクト ロードマップに適切に組み込みます。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to novel questions of law on various topics, including issues that may be new to you and/or the company. / ご自身や会社にとって新しい問題を含め、さまざまなトピックに関する法律の新たな問題点に対処します。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide counsel on proposed legislation and regulations and in negotiations among stakeholders. / 法律と規制の草案やステークホルダー間の交渉について助言します。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with our Policy team on advocacy strategies for engaging with regulators and policymakers. / ポリシーチームと協力して、規制当局や政策立案者に働きかけるためのアドボカシー戦略に取り組みます。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have / 必要な条件/経験:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Law degree (equivalent to LLB, LLM or JD) / 法学の学位（LLB、LLM、または JD に相当するもの）を取得されている方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Admitted to practice law in Japan. / 日本の弁護士資格をお持ちの方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual in Japanese and English, with ability to communicate and translate concepts effectively with colleagues in the United States. / 日本語と英語の両方に堪能で、米国にいる同僚と効果的にコミュニケーションを取り、概念を翻訳する能力がある方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience as an attorney at a firm, in-house at a company, or in government. / 法律事務所、企業、または政府機関の弁護士として 8 年以上勤務した経験がある方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with regulatory and legislative matters in Japan (e.g. engaging in rulemaking processes, advising on legislative bill text, building regulatory compliance programs for a rapidly scaling company with a range of partners). / 日本の規制と法律の問題に携わった経験（規則の制定プロセスへの関与、法案の条文に関する助言、多様なパートナーと協力して急成長中の企業のために規制遵守プログラムを構築した経験など）がある方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn quickly and adapt as the technology and regulatory landscape evolves. / 技術および規制環境の変化に合わせて、迅速に学習し適応できる方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and spoken communication skills. / 文章や口頭でのコミュニケーションに長けている方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate with and ingest input from cross-functional partners.&amp;nbsp; / 部門横断型のパートナーと連携し、パートナーからの意見を吸収できる方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience generating nuanced and pragmatic advice for novel or ambiguous legal issues. / 新しい法的問題や曖昧な法的問題について、微妙な点を踏まえた実用的な助言をした経験がある方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a self-starter and getting things done. / 自発的に行動して物事を成し遂げた経験がある方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to dig into the details and nuances of the law, while at the same time deeply understanding the bigger picture of the legal, policy, and business landscapes. / 法律の細部と微妙な意味合いを掘り下げつつ、法律、政策、およびビジネス環境の全体像を深く理解できる方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire and ability to learn how our complex technology works and apply that knowledge in your legal interpretations and advice. / Waymo の複雑な技術の仕組みを学び、その知識を法律上の解釈や助言に応用する意欲と能力がある方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer / 望ましい経験/スキル:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on emerging technology issues, bonus for experience with technology that impacts non-users of the technology and/or safety. / 新興技術に関する問題に携わった経験がある方。特に、その技術の非ユーザーや安全性に影響を及ぼす技術に関する経験がある方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with teams and cross-functional partners located in different countries. / さまざまな国を拠点とするチームや部門横断型のパートナーと連携して業務を遂行した経験がある方。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;As part of Waymo&#39;s Legal team, you will work on the exciting legal issues surrounding our transformational autonomous driving technology and help drive our business lines forward from technology ideation through scaled commercial deployment. We partner with our public policy, safety, security and privacy experts to define transportation policy for the autonomous driving world to come, advising on regulatory changes that support and protect our users around the world. We collaborate with our engineering, product, strategy and operations teams to develop and protect our intellectual property portfolio and drive our corporate and commercial transactions. We ensure compliance with an increasingly complex and dynamic range of global regulations. And we anticipate, mitigate, and litigate high-profile and precedent-setting legal matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report to a Managing Counsel&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide legal support to various business teams on a variety of issues related to cross border shipments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interact directly with customs officials and work with our Policy team to engage regulators on a variety of trade and supply chain related issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage in cross-functional planning efforts to ensure that trade compliance and strategy are properly incorporated into the project roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide legal support on a variety of supply chain regulations, including equipment certifications and forced labor diligence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop vision, strategy, and implementation for complying with evolving and complex international trade and suppy chain regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;JD degree with a strong academic record, state bar membership, and 10+ years of relevant legal experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid background on and understanding of various cross-legal issues associated with manufacturing and shipping of goods internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in three or more of the following: import and export regulations, equipment certification and licensing, customs investigations, cross-border transactions, sanctions compliance and investigations, forced labor compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with understanding cross-functional perspectives and navigating ambiguity. Ability to identify and create streamlined processes to support a growing company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execution-oriented individual with strong interpersonal, communication, and team skills. Experience presenting to senior management and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eagerness to work in a startup environment and flexibly roll up your sleeves as an individual contributor to help drive our fast-paced and dynamic business within an emerging and rapidly developing industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 15 years of relevant legal experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior in-house experience working side-by-side with engineering, supply chain, logistics, partnerships, marketing, and leadership teams to spot, address, and counsel on trade compliance issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising business and product teams on trade regulations, building out trade compliance programs, and developing strategies to minimize corresponding business risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting the importation of new and emerging technologies internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with legal teams and cross-functional partners located in different countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 15%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$298,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$368,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rigorous performance evaluation of the Waymo Driver is a critical part of scaling our ride hailing service and achieving Waymo’s audacious goals. Waymo data scientists work hand-in-hand with engineering teams at each stage of the software development cycle, employing statistical models and developing metrics and measurement frameworks to ensure that the Waymo Driver meets our strict standards for safety, compliance, and driving and service quality. Autonomous driving presents a new paradigm in data science: in addition to leveraging data collected on-road, we generate our own data using state-of-the-art simulation technology—resulting in denser signals and challenging new problems in estimation and experimental design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this hybrid role you will report to a data science manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Evaluation Frameworks for autonomous vehicle performance, for large-scale ML models, and for the quality of simulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop new metrics, interpret trends, and investigate anomalies in data from simulation and on-road driving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop novel statistical methods to handle unique aspects of AV data; e.g. rate estimation with rare events, combining real and synthetic data, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frame and solve ambiguous problems by scoping technical priorities and innovating on statistical methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Derive data-driven conclusions and communicate findings to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish yourself as the point-of-contact for a significant project area by using data to drive technical decisions and demonstrate success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product and Engineering partners developing the Waymo Driver and Waymo’s simulation software; facilitate deployment readiness decisions for both products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor other data scientists and provide constructive technical feedback within the team and across Waymo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in a quantitative field (e.g. Statistics, Mathematics, Physics)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of industry experience solving data science problems, or a PhD in a quantitative field and 3+ years of industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise using advanced statistical methods in an applied setting; familiarity with ML systems/models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated knowledge of Python/SQL/R data analysis libraries and packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PhD in a quantitative field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated track record of independently driving data science projects to deliver business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience solving problems related to Autonomous Driving or Ride Hailing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in adjacent relevant areas like Advanced Machine Learning (Deep Learning and Diffusion models), Traffic Modeling, Safety Evaluation, Prediction etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$213,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$263,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Waymo&#39;s Compute Team is tasked with a critical and exciting mission: We deliver the compute platform responsible for running the fully autonomous vehicle’s software stack. To achieve our mission, we architect and create high-performance custom silicon; we develop system-level compute architectures that push the boundaries of performance, power, and latency; and we collaborate closely with many other teammates to ensure we design and optimize hardware and software for maximum performance. We are a multidisciplinary team seeking curious and talented teammates to work on one of the world’s highest performance automotive compute platforms. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role follows a hybrid work schedule and you will report to a Silicon Engineering Lead.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive formal strategy for first-pass silicon success. Own the formal verification sign-off approach across complex IP and SoC designs, utilizing advanced formal techniques (e.g., Bounded Model Checking, Datapath Validation, Connectivity, Sequential LEC, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect robust and scalable FV environments. Develop and deploy reusable formal testbenches, methodology flows, and high-coverage SVA assertion suites for systemic deployment across multiple design blocks and projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical leadership &amp;amp; mentorship. Serve as the team&#39;s formal Subject Matter Expert, training and guiding logic designers and verification engineers to effectively incorporate formal methods into their workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic planning and test plan execution. Collaborate with Architecture and Design teams to translate complex system and IP specifications into comprehensive formal verification test plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive FV Infrastructure &amp;amp; Reporting. Maintain and enhance continuous integration, regression flows, and dashboarding to provide clear, actionable formal verification status and sign-off metrics to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced bug-hunting and debugging. Apply state-of-the-art formal techniques (e.g., assume-guarantee, abstractions, reductions) to tackle and efficiently decompose the most challenging, intractable verification problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS/PhD in CS/EE or related field, combined with 5+ years of hands-on formal verification experience on shipping silicon products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, expert-level proficiency with at least one major commercial formal verification platform (e.g., Cadence JasperGold, Synopsys VC Formal, Mentor Questa Formal)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level language proficiency in C++ and/or Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to model complex designs in SystemVerilog and advanced SystemVerilog Assertions, including writing complex cut-points and environment models for effective formal proof convergence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in applying advanced formal debug techniques for problem decomposition (e.g., clock domain crossings, abstractions, assume-guarantee reasoning)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills with the ability to influence cross-functional teams (Design, Architecture, Software) and drive technical alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Informed of latest developments in formal verification research and industry practice, identify opportunities for Waymo&#39;s silicon development process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in formally proving correctness of arithmetic units such as floating point adders and multipliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge/experience working with NOCs and networking topologies, protocols (Eg. AXI/AMBA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand basic principles of cache coherency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with high-performance designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position across US locations is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level. Your recruiter can share more about the specific salary range for the role location or, if the role can be performed remote, the specific salary range for your preferred location, during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$204,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$259,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our Driver may be autonomous, but Waymo&#39;s finances are steered by experts like you. The Finance and Accounting group manages all aspects of our finances and serves as trusted advisors for all our strategic and enterprise endeavors. Along with managing compilation of our financial statements, looking after our cash and overseeing compliance, we partner closely with the business in overseeing company wide resource allocation, developing cutting edge compensation initiatives and generating detailed financial analyses to drive the business forward. We also develop advanced capital strategies to support the company&#39;s short- and long-term future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report to the Head of Business Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end financial analysis for real estate and infrastructure deals, implementing processes to streamline analysis, and ensuring all financials are validated before the deal enters formal review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape infrastructure strategy and unit economics, OPEX, CAPEX, and ensure individual transactions serve the broader roadmap for long-term infrastructure goals at market level, and achieve cost benchmarks by helping teams make trade-offs and decisions to optimize financial targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as finance liaison for the &quot;gate&quot; approval process, ensuring material reviews and buy-ins are finalized and numbers are aligned at each team level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate the internal chain of command by preparing strategic pre-read materials and deal reviews, streamlining the flow of information to move projects from identification to final executive sign-off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business Administration, Finance, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7-10 years of corporate or business finance experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Within corporate finance experience, 4+ years of commercial real estate transaction experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level proficiency in financial modeling and the ability to find &quot;the story&quot; within the data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing multiple complex deals simultaneously under tight deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional ability to present with Executive-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real estate transaction experience in industrial development, leasing or related function&lt;/li&gt;
