&lt;p&gt;The system architecture team handles the onboard contract of the model with the system, including kinematics, interfaces and representations.&amp;nbsp;Our team’s mission is to work across the stack, building the best setup for the model to drive. We tackle this through projects in data, modeling, metrics, and the overall planner system.&lt;/p&gt;
