&lt;li&gt;Drive the development or significantly contribute to end-to-end evaluation systems and benchmarks for Waymo Foundation models, encompassing the entire life-cycle from pre-training and supervised fine-tuning (SFT) to reinforcement learning (RL), for evaluating the quality, safety, and realism of embodied AI agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams within the organization to land innovative tech in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and extend large large scale data and evaluation pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
