&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Engineering with a specialized focus on Control or Estimation, or equivalent practical expertise in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 4 years of experience deploying production-grade automotive control algorithms in C++, with a background in autonomous systems or advanced ADAS&lt;/li&gt;
