&lt;li&gt;Direct experience engineering safety-critical systems where reliability is paramount&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio of open-source contributions that showcase a commitment to writing elegant, high-quality C++ software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Versatility across various control methodologies, including Optimal Control, MPC, Sliding Mode, PID, and Successive Loop Closure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
