&lt;li&gt;Improve the end-to-end RL training pipeline for efficient and scalable learners/actors, and low-latency distributed reply buffers for persisting data produced by the rollouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build evaluations, analyze experimental results and iterate quickly to improve model performance and training workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with the latest research in RL, Vision-Language-Action (VLA) models, and World models to inform and inspire new programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
