&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in coding (e.g., Python, R, SQL), querying databases, and statistical analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot;&gt;Proven ability to lead and deliver on highly ambiguous, high-impact technical projects in a self-directed environment.&lt;/p&gt;
