&lt;p&gt;Cross-Stakeholder Alignment:&amp;nbsp;Proven track record of navigating complex organizations to gather requirements from diverse customers and aligning them into a unified technical roadmap. You can negotiate Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities (R&amp;amp;R) across competing priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
