&lt;li&gt;8+ years of industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong C++ programming skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with optimizing CPU or GPU code (ideally both)&lt;/li&gt;
