. These pipelines often have a strong aspect of sensing technology, but also stretch the entire Perception stack and interfacing with planning as well.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In this hybrid role you will report to a Director and manage and grow a team of engineers working on Perception ML pipelines.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
