&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SMS Policy Maintenance:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the SMS Lead in the development, periodic review, revision, and version control and implementation support for enterprise-level safety policies and governance documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Management &amp;amp; Promotion:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and spearhead closed-loop processes for maintaining a positive safety culture, and other internal initiatives (e.g., Safety Month, newsletters, town halls) to promote safety awareness and reinforce a positive safety culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist in the management of safety committees and working groups, ensuring alignment between policy objectives and effective departmental implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a primary point of contact for internal teams to interpret safety policies and gather feedback on how to improve all aspects of the SMS and the &quot;lived&quot; safety culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Goals &amp;amp; Metrics:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and track SMS-related goals and Safety Performance Indicators (SPIs) related to the SMS broadly, safety culture maturity, and policy compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Learning &amp;amp; Development teams to ensure safety policies are effectively integrated into onboarding and continuous training programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5 years of experience in Safety Management Systems (SMS), Organizational Development, or Corporate Governance within safety-sensitive industries (AV, aviation, nuclear, automotive, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in technical writing and maintaining complex policy frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading culture-change initiatives or internal communication programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of inclusive culture principles and ability to succeed in a diverse and dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional interpersonal and influence skills, with the ability to engage stakeholders at all levels of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
