&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role follows a hybrid work schedule and you will report to a Team lead, Sensing Systems Test Engineering.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
