&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Workforce Architecture &amp;amp; Business Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the Vendor Enablement Office and executive stakeholders (Engineering, Marketing, Safety, Ops) to design global outsourcing footprints for critical functions like Mapping, Labeling, and Hardware. You will drive alignment on the $100M+ portfolio, shifting from transactional vendor usage to strategic capability building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Supplier Alliances:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate high-level relationships with key market leaders in the BPO and Engineering Services landscape. You will bridge the gap between Waymo’s internal needs and external market capabilities, establishing deep partnerships that unlock innovation and preferential access to talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Operations Category Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the category strategy and transformation roadmap for Waymo’s critical operations, ensuring resilience, scalability, and cost-optimization to support rapid market expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect complex, bespoke commercial agreements for Hardware Engineering Services and technical outsourcing, introducing outcome-based models that share risk and reward with strategic partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Governance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Own the governance framework for Third-Party Risk in the services sector, ensuring IP protection and data security compliance across a global supplier base.&lt;/li&gt;
