&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Vision:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ability to look 3-5 years out and design a supply base that can support exponential business growth, rather than just solving for today&#39;s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
