&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS in Comp Sci, EE, Robotics, Physics, Math, or related field (or equivalent experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 years of software engineering experience on large scale/high complexity system (supported by hundreds of engineers)&lt;/li&gt;
