&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Innovate and Develop: Join our world-class research engineering team to drive innovation in ultra-realistic sensor data and perception simulation for autonomous vehicles. You will develop the latest simulation technologies using 3D Gaussian Splatting, foundational models for sensor data, and traditional 3D graphics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead and Scale: Lead the deployment and scaling of sensor simulation to solve some of Waymo&#39;s hardest challenges. You will work in a highly cross-functional environment, collaborating with research, systems engineering, and other teams to accelerate company objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Transfer Research to Production: Work closely with Waymo&#39;s foundational AI research team to turn state-of-the-art research into scalable and production-ready solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MS in Computer Science, Machine Learning (ML), Robotics, or a related technical field, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
