&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Industry Experience: 8+ years of experience in software engineering, with at least 5+ years of experience in machine learning-based 3D Reconstruction techniques such as 3D Gaussian Splatting (3DGS) and Neural Radiance Fields (NeRF), or traditional 3D reconstruction and rendering pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Fluency: Fluency in Python and C++, with experience developing ML software using frameworks like PyTorch, TensorFlow, and Jax/Flax.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
